icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172440\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Room\" title=\"Boss Room\"><img alt=\"Boss Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/30/Boss_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102031\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Library\" title=\"Library\"><img alt=\"Library Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Library Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Library_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/41/Library_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102229\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>A <b>Maggot</b> is a type of monster introduced in the vanilla content of <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Binding_of_Isaac:_Rebirth\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth\">The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth</a></i>. They can be commonly found in <a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Chapter 2\">Chapter 2</a>. <span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-14\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth\"><img alt=\"(except in Rebirth)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/95/Dlc_a_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220122155526\" /></span></span>  They can also be found wandering about within <a href=\"/wiki/Library\" title=\"Library\">libraries</a>.\n</p><p>As their name suggests, they're blind, white insect maggots that lack any appendages. They crawl around the room slowly and aimlessly, but will deal damage upon full contact.\n</p>\n\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Small_Maggot\">Small Maggot</span></h3><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"S\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat S.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_S.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f8/Font_TeamMeat_S.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822055932\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"m\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat m.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_m.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/7b/Font_TeamMeat_m.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060812\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"a\" src=\"data